      "source_groundedness": 0.75,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Food quality is a relevant grouping dimension. Values mostly grounded ('excellent' for outstanding-food row, 'Unknown' appropriately for the baggage-complaint row). Row 1 'adequate' is unsupported since food isn't mentioned, a minor invented value."
    },
